  "created": "2026-11-05T23:34:22.9Z",
  "description": "A complete, accurate port of the KosherJava Zmanim API (3.1.0) to .NET. Calculates sunrise, sunset, twilight and Jewish halachic times (zmanim) with the NOAA, NREL SPA, Jean Meeus and USNO algorithms, and provides the Jewish calendar (holidays, parshah, daf yomi, molad, tefila rules) and Hebrew date formatting. Uses only native .NET types (DateTimeOffset, DateOnly, TimeOnly, TimeSpan, TimeZoneInfo) - no NodaTime. Results are verified against KosherJava itself.",
